// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2065912899" "My operatives have Dr. Aeon to work on the anti-phase sequencer project!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1495446313" "Dr. Aeon has provided us with a few anti-phase weapons which he said should prove very effective against ghosts! While he was unable to provide me with an anti-phase sequencer defense system for my armor, the anti-phase weapons should prove to be a good offensive deterrent.<br><br>Of course, I would like to test these weapons before I incorporate them into my armor. I've gotten the Mu Mystics to locate a place in Paragon City with a high sightings of supernatural manifestations - a graveyard. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to Paragon City and test out the anti-ghost weapons!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P449797321" "Test anti-ghost weapons"
// SendOffString :
"P3255632663" "Yes, they're anti-ghost weapons. Not that I have a problem with ghosts. Just one in particular."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3873941832" "If the tests are successful, I'm going to look at incorporating the weapons into my Scorpion armor!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2961831341" "You make your way to this haunted graveyard in Paragon City. Test Dr. Aeon's anti-ghost weapons by taking out the ghostly leader and his henchman!"
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P1430601346" "You travel back to the Rogue Isles and depart the boat."

