// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3180545385" "You've spoken with Arbiter Daos? Excellent! I'll let you have the honor of eliminating precious little scientist, Dr. Aeon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3142465825" "Rescue Dr. Aeon from the clutches of Silver Mantis!"

